     "body": "<p>This is mostly resolved at this point. See <a href=\"http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/x/FwzS\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/x/FwzS</a> (until Dan has finished integrating my steps in the overall document, refer to my notes of 3 November at the end of the document).</p>",
