     "body": "<p>Sounds like this should be closed.... are builds now working properly in Eclipse as documented at: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/Eclipse%2C+Git+and+Maven+Setup+for+Fedora\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/Eclipse%2C+Git+and+Maven+Setup+for+Fedora</a><br/>\n??? If so, the issue should be closed.</p>",
